{"pin":"AB00305","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00305","anchor":"","first_line":"...Verily, each one of the Manifestations in former ages possessed a certain station in existence and a certain rank in human development [3.5s]... ...Were it not for tests genuine gold could not be distinguished from the counterfeit.... In cycles gone by, each one of the Manifestations of God hath had His own rank in the world of existence... Intellect and the faculty of comprehension are God's gifts","first_line_orig":"انّ الظّهورات فی الأدوار السّابقة کان لکلّ واحد منهم شأن فی الوجود و رتبة فی نشأة الأنسان  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"680","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#027 p.054x","source":"MMK1","locator":"027 p.054x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/696257448"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MNMK#063 p.142x","source":"MNMK","locator":"063 p.142x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MMAB/mmab-140.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BSTW#438","source":"BSTW","locator":"438","url":"http://www.h-net.org/~bahai/docs/vol13/Barstow_401-450.pdf#page=38"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#1790x","source":"COC","locator":"1790x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/compilation_prohibition_drinking_alcohol#1790"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SWAB#027x","source":"SWAB","locator":"027x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/359912913"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SW_v08#19 p.238-239x","source":"SW_v08","locator":"19 p.238-239x","url":"https://bahai.works/Star_of_the_West/Volume_8/Issue_19"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SW_v14#02 p.041-042x","source":"SW_v14","locator":"02 p.041-042x","url":"https://bahai.works/Star_of_the_West/Volume_14/Issue_2"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SW_v14#12 p.353x","source":"SW_v14","locator":"12 p.353x",